{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "43a8d63156e25c8bad644097e7da940bdd08e58fb5c8aea218c7906d2059685f", "ja": "終わりの先を往く者達", "zh": "前往终焉前方的行者们", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "778be529cafee490db7dd935daf431495f8ed71f9d69046653d5f2deed3f47ae", "ja": "映画『近未来アウトサイダー』の撮影がいよ\nいよ始まった！　千早、美希、春香、真の演\n技を間近で見て感銘を受けたエミリーは、自\n分も恥ずかしくない演技をしたいと気合いを\n入れる。", "zh": "电影《近未来局外人》的拍摄终于开始了！艾米莉近距离观看千早、美希、春香和真演戏后深受感动，也鼓起干劲，想要展现出不逊色于她们的演技。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5f8a8f3486fd996d5cec3b471dda0dde8d6558014f7c1357ed4dcdfb19a7bd2f", "ja": "（スチル撮影から1ヶ月。『近未来アウトサイダー』を\nテーマにした映画が、いよいよクランクインした！）", "zh": "（距离静态照片拍摄已经过了1个月，以《近未来局外人》为主题的电影终于要开拍了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_02_1001_p", "source_sha256": "4ee4e3061e9f0b7a9b4192cdf7031e13e58f55c19170a610dd9a56101f7d2cad", "ja": "（今日の撮影は、映画では冒頭にあたるシーン。\n美希と千早の2人が、荒野で出会うところだ……）", "zh": "（今天拍摄的是电影开头的场景。美希和千早两人的2相遇在荒野……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_02_1002_003mik", "source_sha256": "86201449015dafc8202e80d77a4a561868d0f284cdfea0dfba8c981e8f4ecffc", "ja": "はぁ……ペッペッ。\n相変わらず、ひどい砂ぼこりだ。……ん？", "zh": "哈啊……呸呸。\n还是这么大的沙尘啊。……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_02_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "fe65979217871fcbf2a817053a43dde480369aa7dfb955baba1f291911ef70e8", "ja": "こんな砂の中に、人……？　おい、お前。\n野垂れ死にするのは構わないが、俺の前ではやめろ。", "zh": "在这样的沙子里，居然有人……？喂，你。\n要横尸荒野随你便，但别死在我面前。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_02_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "f029df204f78378a894648efe7f488d40f912caaa1a6b8f9361e33856663a279", "ja": "何か握ってるな。……って、政府の徽章だって！？\nお前……これを、どこで手に入れた！", "zh": "你手里攥着什么呢。……等等，这是政府的徽章！？\n你……这是从哪里弄到的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_02_1006_002chi", "source_sha256": "3a2a0b600b337455ef7ea8a3f83dece1cfd841bf4e9418725af7998926515e20", "ja": "ア……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_02_1007_003mik", "source_sha256": "4260fce3a4bac04a2bdf6a2502dea229eaf4bf75f29c754cfebfa9bd6a205a20", "ja": "あ？", "zh": "谢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_02_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "471d4faef87075a4adba4bc067a520ca0b790d87da62c5194536025e04c3d7bb", "ja": "アマ……リリス……。\n……。", "zh": "阿玛……莉莉丝……。\n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_02_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "c6bb261165abc950247a6bead9c7df731fd6c9d705d199e7b88f050170132f94", "ja": "話ができる状態じゃないな。とはいえ、このまま\n砂漠に放り出したら、明朝には冷たくなってそうだし。", "zh": "现在根本没法好好说话。不过，要是就这样扔在沙漠里，到了明早估计就凉了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_02_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "2a83d770238f568ef4ca245b6a2154a07187f2cb48a53fc5e808762be3044684", "ja": "ったく、とんだ拾い物だ。\n……おいお前、助けてやるんだから死ぬなよ？", "zh": "真是的，捡到个不得了的家伙。  \n……喂，你这家伙，我可是要救你的，别死了啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_02_1012_032emi", "source_sha256": "25be76b8c9ffce3b15b046a3ea1187c8b40e119d556a5e9a218760d6fa1ba5b6", "ja": "わぁ……！", "zh": "哇……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_02_1013_003mik", "source_sha256": "f5d72345bab8a96871db33a74b711c1f65baa530bd418b3e5024866fca039dea", "ja": "ただいまなの～。うう……\n砂で口の中がジャリジャリする……。", "zh": "我回来啦～。呜呜……\n嘴里全是沙子，硌得慌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_02_1014_002chi", "source_sha256": "244ec588e5873c48bd0f505b4e44a5877eef4d3b10a0d4c3b4801439849803d2", "ja": "やっぱり、難しいですね……。\n少ないセリフで、感情を表現するのは。", "zh": "果然还是很难呢……\n要用这么少的台词来表现感情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_02_1015_003mik", "source_sha256": "8a36d2b42278eb8d5212ba87db2fafb4170171f4ccbd1213655c3dd90e95c910", "ja": "ミキ的には、カッコよくできたって思うけど。\n{$P$}、どうだった？", "zh": "不过，美希觉得自己演得挺帅的。{$P$}，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_02_1016_p", "source_sha256": "ea1b9f845b674df50ff4d91bcd22318c4dd861c4441af736d1355d351ddc296b", "ja": "ふたりとも、最初にしては良かったよ。\nこの映画らしい雰囲気が出せていたと思う。", "zh": "你们两个第一次演就表现得很好。\n我觉得已经营造出了这部电影特有的氛围。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_02_1017_032emi", "source_sha256": "38c12b9c47beafd4b870adce4c04d52e57eb50855e3968cade3d8a6a96696218", "ja": "はい！　千早さんも美希さんも、とっても素敵でした！\n思わず、物語に引きこまれてしまいそうでした……。", "zh": "是的！千早小姐和美希小姐都表现得非常精彩！\n不知不觉间，我都快要被故事吸引进去了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_02_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "c2f86624048924f7782efb366c7f5c390e691fcd4966d6404a0798394d35cd9a", "ja": "よーしっ、それじゃ次はボク達の出番だね！\nよろしくね、春香！", "zh": "好——嘞，那接下来就轮到我们出场了呢！\n请多指教啦，春香！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_02_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "0c9e16ee023c33dddce730c86db68f3349fc0c548cbed5553c73c76df37a19f0", "ja": "うん！　うう、さすがにちょっと緊張するなぁ……\nそれじゃあ、行ってきますっ！", "zh": "嗯！呜，果然还是有点紧张啊……\n那我出发了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_02_1020_006mak", "source_sha256": "761657898f17eff8d0ce1aae489eff9bbf46e3cff909787762d3505a96e47dfe", "ja": "ファイナルデイ様、伝令からの報告です。\n西の連中、降伏勧告を受け入れるって。", "zh": "法伊娜尔蒂大人，这是传令兵的报告。  \n西边那帮人说要接受劝降。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_02_1021_006mak", "source_sha256": "d31410fd2302806c40bb28d67a6d2fe25639a0feb3d8a9cf35e34dd57079a7d3", "ja": "ったく、戦えるヤツが死んだら途端にコレだ。\nどうしますか？　オレが皆殺しにしてきましょうか？", "zh": "真是的，能打的家伙一死，立马就变成这样了。怎么办？要不要我去把他们全杀了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_02_1022_001har", "source_sha256": "d67437a633be356760070c7f1758370acbccf9aeec48e9d2f9921ee815bf1e10", "ja": "いや。従う者には、慈悲を与える。\nそれが、我がアウトレイジ軍の掟だ。", "zh": "不。顺从者，可得慈悲。\n这便是我暴怒军的铁律。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_02_1023_006mak", "source_sha256": "8135e99d2ef4bf24a5597a6d8bfd3b214eecd65e24987c0434ce1ac24b4a08e0", "ja": "ファイナルデイ様がそれでいいなら、\nオレは構いませんけど……。", "zh": "只要终焉之日大人觉得这样没问题，我倒是无所谓……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_02_1024_001har", "source_sha256": "b2dbf4786a15e77a99b2bd479833639d34ddc7e99779695e136a82f5d0439d31", "ja": "愚かな人々も、そう遠くない未来に気付くだろう。\n……この世界は、いずれひとつになる。", "zh": "愚蠢的人们也会在不远的将来察觉到的。\n……这个世界，终将合而为一。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_02_1025_001har", "source_sha256": "c2e2bc80c7e14194f80ee6649aa551ec46a8bcb2d641748a21f560d132ba7569", "ja": "世界が終わりを告げるよりも早く。\n愚者も賢者も、統一されなければならないのだ。", "zh": "在世界宣告终结之前。  \n无论愚者还是贤者，都必须归于一统。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_02_1026_001har", "source_sha256": "d414ad13aee5b3cf80806b5e1ea18d1ed74622e9328a856be2f0d8854f4e0ac0", "ja": "そのための障害は、全て排除するだけ。\n……ベルベット、期待しているぞ。", "zh": "因此，只要将所有障碍排除就行。  \n……Velvet，我期待着你的表现。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_02_1027_006mak", "source_sha256": "71e9ccdfb1854a1359a1509c16624e935e697f5898b635c5da06220d0b063206", "ja": "はっ！\nオレの力はすべて、ファイナルデイ様のために！", "zh": "哈！\n我的全部力量，都是为了最终之日大人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_02_1029_001har", "source_sha256": "ab7b6097bc823b7308746861b26d1e661c7983e61802b42d2c31d177553e421a", "ja": "お疲れさまでした！　ど、どうでしたか？\nちゃんと、お芝居できてたかな……？", "zh": "辛苦了！刚、刚才演得怎么样？\n我有没有好好演好这个角色呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_02_1030_002chi", "source_sha256": "256850402fd8cb29eefa0002475063d42d1e23165181b69ce9ad3b08b6175a7a", "ja": "お疲れさま、春香。\nさすがね。すごく役に入り込めていたと思うわ。", "zh": "辛苦了，春香。\n不愧是你。我觉得你非常投入角色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_02_1031_003mik", "source_sha256": "2bb71c898af65678212c5f354f21fd56d555b06a8e7ac65735f03f2a656fcd56", "ja": "真くん、かっこよかったの～。\nミキと一緒のシーン、楽しみだね！　あはっ☆", "zh": "真很帅气呢～  \n和美希一起的场景，我很期待哦！啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_02_1032_006mak", "source_sha256": "944254e3f992ace7a71af62bb8e0741c4dbaffaa4c157f902d6a3cf83a9c65db", "ja": "ありがとう、美希！　うん、アウトレイジ軍の特攻隊長\nとして、カッコよさでは負けないからね！　へへっ♪", "zh": "谢谢你，美希！嗯，作为暴徒军的特攻队长，\n我可不会在帅气这方面输给你哦！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_02_1033_p", "source_sha256": "59d828929b2c779484c1fde64532e2e0104c6f1fb856889d8165689097ca6146", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま！\n順調な滑り出しだな。この調子で頑張ろう！", "zh": "大家辛苦了！\n开了个好头，就照这个势头继续努力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_02_1034_032emi", "source_sha256": "88df608639c5721b703d0af12ac0aff13a5f3de4c92605995771328da3a55e2b", "ja": "すごい……すごいです！　私、感動しました！\nみなさんと共演できて、本当にうれしいです……！", "zh": "好厉害……太厉害了！我真的好感动！\n能和大家一起演出，我真的非常开心……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_02_1035_p", "source_sha256": "7e88ed7c3c2d030ebc2f64b4fc274e4e88a405ada1b8fc6abc5e515f54fe4e6a", "ja": "エミリーにとっても、刺激になったみたいだな。\nアマリリスの出番もすぐだから、準備しておこうか。", "zh": "对艾米莉来说，似乎也受到了很大的刺激。\n木槿花的出场也马上就要到了，我们准备一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
